      "id": "claim_27c50143e6e849b7b1c45a9400544811",
      "statement": "MiddlewarePipeline is constructed once per UseFramework instance in the constructor and its execute is invoked from exactly one place, UseFramework.__call__, after the lazy build and the implicit context overlay are established; the buses never reference middleware, so framework(dto) is the only route that applies the chain and bus.thread_context()/AsyncBus/direct bus calls bypass it.",
