      "id": "claim_495c635dbcd3494cb12f1ebf9c9c9aa2",
      "statement": "The chain runs once per framework(dto) call and before FrameworkBus routing, so it applies identically to DTOs handled by a Feature and by an ApplicationService and cannot know which layer will execute them; there is no per-DTO or per-layer targeting, so a middleware must decide for itself by inspecting the DTO (documented practice uses hasattr/isinstance guards).",
