    {
      "id": "claim_aa80ac241e384316af799f7e645d3381",
      "statement": "The middleware pipeline is per-instance startup state that build_root_bus() neither creates nor resets, so add_middleware takes effect immediately whether it is called before or after the first execution; middlewares is a plain List that execute iterates live, so mutating it concurrently with in-flight calls is unguarded (the README records the same caveat for all startup-built collections).",
