    {
      "id": "claim_95e542640c0e4b1da33c472743bee919",
      "statement": "The shipped middleware system is the minimal protocol plus a synchronous forward loop; the richer interceptor design described in docs/prd/PRD_02_middleware-system.md (a BaseMiddleware class, priority sorting, per-middleware should_execute, a response pipeline) is not implemented in sincpro_framework/middleware.py, and no post-execution or async middleware exists.",
